        "text": "Root cause: The smtp-relay service is failing to send emails due to an authentication error (\"API key revoked\"). The secrets-agent attempted to rotate the mail/sendgrid-api-key but failed with a 403 permission error, so the new key was never written. This left smtp-relay with an invalid API key.\n\nAction taken: Restarted smtp-relay, email-worker, and secrets-agent, but the issue persisted because the secrets-agent still lacks permission to update the key. I have paged the on-call engineer, as resolving the permission issue is beyond my available tools.\n\nAffected service: smtp-relay (and downstream email-worker).",
